{
  "headline": "FDA's records show Corvale East and Corvale Lakeside share the same NDC (70518249900) from REMEDYREPACK INC. with plant SANDOZ (sponsor only); Corvale General uses a different NDC (71205059301) from Proficient Rx LP (VAI 2022-12-08)",
  "headline_cites": ["E1", "E4", "E2", "E5", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Corvale East and Corvale Lakeside both stock ceftriaxone sodium under NDC 70518249900 labeled by REMEDYREPACK INC. and manufactured at the SANDOZ plant, which is linked as sponsor only.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E4", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General carries two NDCs: 70518249900 from REMEDYREPACK INC. and 71205059301 from Proficient Rx LP, the latter inspected by FDA and classified VAI on 2022-12-08.",
      "cites": ["E2", "E3", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Proficient Rx LP (FEI 3011557028) also received a VAI classification on 2015-10-22 per FDA inspection 948193.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory shows Corvale East with 20 days on hand, Corvale General with 18 days, and Corvale Lakeside with 9 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 22 units from Corvale East to Corvale Lakeside would leave East with roughly two weeks of supply and bring Lakeside to about 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because the SANDOZ plant link is sponsor only and the Proficient Rx LP plant has only VAI inspections, verify whether any OAI actions or supply disruptions exist for these facilities.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E8", "E6", "E7"]
    }
  ]
}
